  "documentation": "This block creates a variable with a label widget for text. Leave the label blank to use the variable id as the label.\n\nThe GUI hint can be used to position the widget within the application. The hint is of the form [tab_id@tab_index]: [row, col, row_span, col_span]. Both the tab specification and the grid position are optional.",
